  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a molcajete over medium heat.",
    "Add cumin seeds and sauté until fragrant, about 30 seconds.",
    "Add sliced onion and minced garlic; cook until the onion is translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in diced sweet potato, smoked paprika, and cayenne pepper, cooking for 1 minute.",
    "Add shredded cabbage and cherry tomato halves, stirring to coat the vegetables with the spices.",
    "Pour in vegetable broth, bring to a simmer, cover, and cook for 15 minutes until the sweet potato is tender.",
    "Stir in lemon juice, season with salt and pepper, and simmer for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley before serving."
